  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-19T08:08:31.509Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The system I have in mind would be an improvement, and would solve some of the issues people have, as well as take (hopefully) minimal work to implement. \n\nIt would work as follows:\n\nHave two columns in the UI, one would show the avatar stats without counting disabled objects, and would be titled as \"Active.\"\n\nThe other column would show everything on the avatar, including disabled objects, and be called \"Potential.\"\n\n\nYou would then have the option to block with the performance rating, based on either Potential, or based on Active stats.\n\n\nThis adds more granularity, clarity, and information for users to control and see.",
